 */

/**
 * \defgroup PandoraMonitoring PandoraMonitoring
 * \brief Monitoring tools for Pandora, mostly comprised of ROOT-integrations for visualisation and outputs.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup LArContent LArContent
 * \brief Core LArTPC algorithms and classes for 2D and 3D reconstruction.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup LArReco LArReco
 * \brief Top-level application for LArTPC reconstruction, to load and run over a given input file.
 */

/**
 * \defgroup LArRecoND LArRecoND
 * \brief Top-level application for 3D Pixel-based reconstruction for the DUNE ND and its prototypes, to load and run over a given input file.
 */
